  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Pistols, SMGs, and Assault Rifles not fired with the Heavy Weapons Skill</p>\n<p><em>While typically a toy for wannabes, this odd mechanism can be quite lethal in the hands of skilled users by firing when the trigger is pulled and when it’s released, doubling the amount of lead sent downrange.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV21 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Binary Trigger may be installed. The weapon is now incapable of Autofire and Suppressive Fire if not already so. When firing the weapon in Single Shot (including Burst Fire modes), the user may choose to expend double the amount of ammunition and suffer a -2 penalty to their Attack Check. If this attack hits, the user adds +2 to its total damage before it interacts with the target’s armor. Incompatible with Match Trigger and Solenoid Mechanism.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Triggers).</em></p>"
